WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:10.670
Living in an increasingly competitive world, college students should better prepare themselves to confront various challenges.
生活在一个竞争日益激烈的世界里，大学生应该让自己做好更充分的准备，以应对各种挑战。

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:21.610
Whether it is a tough job market, rapid technological change or an unexpected setback, the challenges awaiting today’s graduates are more complex than ever before.
无论是严峻的就业市场、快速的技术变革，还是意想不到的挫折，如今毕业生面临的挑战都比以往任何时候更加复杂。

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.430
Good preparation involves more than earning high grades.
充分的准备不只是取得高分。

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:35.340
First, students need solid professional knowledge and practical skills, which they can gain through course projects, academic competitions and part-time jobs.
首先，学生需要扎实的专业知识和实践技能，这些可以通过课程项目、学术竞赛和兼职工作获得。

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:43.070
Second, they should develop the habit of lifelong learning, because some of what they learn in college may soon become outdated.
其次，他们应该养成终身学习的习惯，因为他们在大学里学到的一些东西可能很快就会过时。

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:49.920
Third, and perhaps most importantly, they must build mental strength so that setbacks do not defeat them.
第三，也许也是最重要的一点，他们必须锻炼强大的心理素质，这样挫折才不会把他们击垮。

00:00:50.720 --> 00:01:03.250
A senior student I know failed his first three job interviews, but instead of losing heart, he analyzed his weaknesses, practiced with friends and finally received an offer from a company he had long admired.
我认识的一位大四学生前三次求职面试都失败了，但他没有灰心，而是分析自己的不足，和朋友一起练习，最终拿到了一家他仰慕已久的公司的录用通知。

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:08.650
In short, challenges are inevitable, but they need not be frightening.
总之，挑战是不可避免的，但它们不必令人害怕。

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:13.850
In fact, every obstacle students overcome will make them stronger.
事实上，学生克服的每一个障碍都会让他们变得更加强大。

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:24.760
If college students make full use of their four years to sharpen their skills and strengthen their character, they will be able to face whatever comes their way calmly and confidently.
如果大学生充分利用四年时光来提升技能、磨炼品格，他们就能够沉着、自信地面对人生道路上的一切。
